# Project Map

Before modifying any file, read `docs/AI_PROJECT_MAP.md` to locate the correct module and path.

Key module locations:
- Auth: `src/lib/auth/**`
- Crawl: `src/lib/crawl/**`
- Enrichment: `src/lib/enrichment/**`
- Hospital Offers: `src/lib/hospitalOffers/**`
- RAG: `src/lib/rag/**`
- Chat: `src/lib/chat/**`
- Notifications: `src/lib/notifications/**`
- Security: `src/lib/security/**`
- Admin API: `app/api/admin/**`
- Admin UI: `app/admin/**`
- Middleware: `middleware.ts` (root)
- i18n: `src/lib/i18n/index.js`
- DB schema: `migrations/`

If you cannot locate a referenced path, stop and ask — do not guess.

# Guardrails (non-negotiable)

- No booking or payment features (lead generation only)
- Do not encourage direct hospital contact — route to HEALO inquiry
- No evidence-free medical claims — only evidence-based summarization
- Do not make HEALO appear to be a hospital or medical institution
- Supabase is the single source of truth — no frontend mock data or fallback constants
- Detail pages must fetch data by URL param (id/slug) directly from DB
